  "slug": "remote-graduate-transport-planner-curtins-1137542",
  "id": "1137542",
  "epoch": 1792224050,
  "date": "2026-10-17T08:00:50+00:00",
  "company": "Curtins",
  "company_logo": "",
  "position": "Graduate Transport Planner",
  "tags": [
   "hr",
   "education",
   "consulting",
   "technical",
   "customer support",
   "marketing",
   "travel",
   "medical",
   "engineer"
  ],
  "description": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;At Curtins, we&#39;re an employee-owned engineering consultancy driven by a simple ambition: to create a better built environment for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;For over 65 years, we&#39;ve delivered practical, innovative and sustainable solutions that make a positive impact on communities across the UK and Ireland. From major regeneration schemes and commercial developments to education, healthcare and residential projects, our work helps shape the places where people live, learn, work and thrive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;As a Graduate Transport Planner, you&#39;ll work alongside experienced planners, engineers and consultants, contributing to a wide range of projects while developing the technical and professional skills you need to build your career.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Whether you&#39;re interested in transport assessments, active travel &amp;amp; sustainable mobility, highways or public transport, we&#39;ll give you the experience, guidance and support to find the areas that interest you most and develop your expertise in development planning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;You will support the planning and development process, helping clients bring projects forward from initial concept through to planning approval.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Assisting with the preparation of Transport Assessments and Transport Statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Supporting the production of Travel Plans and technical planning reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Analysing traffic, transport and movement data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Assisting with junction assessments and development impact studies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Supporting planning applications for residential, commercial and mixed-use developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Working alongside planners, civil engineers and other specialists to deliver integrated solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Attending client meetings, project discussions and stakeholder consultations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Taking part in wider Curtins activities including STEM outreach, charity initiatives and community projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4 class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What kind of projects will I get to work on?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;You&#39;ll be involved in projects across a wide range of sectors, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Residential developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Urban regeneration schemes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Commercial and industrial projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Education and healthcare developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Mixed-use masterplans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Strategic land and development opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;You&#39;ll help assess how developments interact with the transport network and support clients through the planning process, helping turn ideas into deliverable projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will Curtins support my development?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Our goal is simple: to help you become the best engineer you can be.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Through the Curtins Graduate Academy, you&#39;ll follow a structured development programme designed to accelerate both your technical and professional growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;You&#39;ll benefit from:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;A structured graduate development programme.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Dedicated mentoring and coaching.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Regular technical and professional skills training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Support towards professional registration and Chartership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Exposure to a wide range of projects, clients and sectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Opportunities to build your network across the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;You&#39;ll be supported by experienced professionals who are genuinely invested in your success and development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;We&#39;re looking for graduates who are curious, analytical and interested in how development projects are planned and delivered.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;You&#39;ll ideally be studying towards or have recently completed a degree in:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transport Planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Geography&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Urban Planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Civil Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Town Planning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Geography or a related discipline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;It would also be advantageous to hold an MSc in Transport Planning, Transport Engineering, Urban Planning, or Development Planning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Most importantly, we&#39;re looking for people who share our values:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; - Doing the right thing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Being Human&lt;/strong&gt; - Supporting and respecting others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity&lt;/strong&gt; - Asking questions and seeking better solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact&lt;/strong&gt; - Making a meaningful difference through our work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;h4 class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Curtins?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;As an employee-owned business, every person at Curtins contributes to and benefits from our success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Alongside exciting projects and a supportive culture, you&#39;ll enjoy:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Industry-leading benefits package.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Award-winning training and development programmes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Employee ownership benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Opportunities to get involved in STEM, charity and community initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Access to our unique Employee Extras, including our 5-star holiday lodges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Most importantly, you&#39;ll be joining a business where your ideas matter, your development is supported and your contribution makes a real difference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build your future with Curtins.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Should you wish to discuss any adjustments to the application process or provide us with feedback please contact [email] we would be happy to discuss ways we can make the process more suitable to your needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We value diversity and respect all differences in people. We invite enthusiastic individuals who share in our values of teamwork, client focus, integrity, and quality to apply to join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;<br/><br/>Please mention the word **UNRIVALED** and tag RMTAzLjEyMS4xMi4xODU= when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMTAzLjEyMS4xMi4xODU=). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.",
